{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_d55", "label": "D-55 Backup and migration \u2014 simple, done by the server admin (\u0420\u0415\u0428\u0415\u041d\u041e, user answers 2026-10-26 \u00ab\u0423\u0434\u0432\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u043e!\u00bb, recorded 2026-10-27)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "User: \u00ab\u041d\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u043b\u043e\u0436\u043d\u044f\u0439\u00bb \u2014 the server's sysadmin backs up over SSH himself; our job is to make it easy and reliable"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_nightly_backups_existing", "label": "Existing nightly backups: 03:17, kept 14 days in /opt/datascratch/backups/ on the server; restore verified in CI \u2014 stay as is", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_rejected_extras", "label": "Not doing (KISS): external storage, \u00abbackup now\u00bb and \u00abmigrate\u00bb buttons in GitHub Actions, restoring the server from a device", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_admin_ssh_commands", "label": "Admin backs up over SSH with simple commands: backup now (prints file path and size), list backups, restore in one command (integrity check and current data saved first)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_migration_recipe", "label": "Migration recipe in infra/DEPLOY.md: scp the backup file, install server, restore, switch DNS; new domain \u2192 people enter the new address in the app (D-49), no new build", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_offsite_copy_admin_duty", "label": "Moving copies elsewhere is the admin's duty; instructions give scp/rsync example", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_kms_key_first_install_message", "label": "First install ends with a prominent DS_KMS_KEY message: what it is (needed for \u00abfor agents\u00bb notebooks), where it lies (/opt/datascratch/.env), save it in a password manager, it is deliberately excluded from backups and what happens if lost", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_server_commands", "label": "Consequences for server: backup / list / restore commands (wrappers over infra/backup.sh and restore.sh), DS_KMS_KEY message, \u00ab\u0411\u044d\u043a\u0430\u043f \u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0435\u0437\u0434\u00bb section in infra/DEPLOY.md", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0055_backup_simple_loss_if_server_gone", "label": "If the server disappears with its copies, data cannot be recovered \u2014 off-server copies are the admin's responsibility (accepted)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0055-backup-simple.md", "source_locatio